      "title": "How Claude remembers your project: each session begins with a fresh context window; Claude reads CLAUDE.md at the start of every session; locations (~/.claude/CLAUDE.md, ./CLAUDE.md or ./.claude/CLAUDE.md, ./CLAUDE.local.md); files above the working directory load at launch and are concatenated; subdirectories on demand; /init generates a starting CLAUDE.md, suggests improvements if one exists; /context lists Memory files",
